      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I am no expert in programming or games, but I can say that I'm very disappointed because it crushed my creativity. A button would be more realistic. I just want to point out that it might not the limit of particles that makes the game lags. I just tested out one of my model with few to none emitters. It's a raining cloud. Was lagging before the update and still is ! There's literally no change.  Oh and the ''death guns'' anyone pointed out still works. I just encountered someone who had one and he was kind enough to show me that it still worked. He could crash people one by one. Also, I am one of many that started working on animations for Vrchat. I've been planning on doing more and more but now that it's limited, I've lost all of my really cool animations. Some of them had like a thousand particles (even more) and they were still working. It was optimized. I am one of many who bought particle effects on the assets store. I spent money on this and now it's jammed. Again, please add a button.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
