      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Another particle is a very innocuous one which deeply offends me, I have a thunderfury model with a working glowing orb at its core that is just a few sprite sheet animations positioned into a sphere, with smoke, sparkles and lens flares, very tiny. With extremely small flickering lightning particles that crawl up and down the blade.\n\nIt literally will fizzle in about 3 seconds so then it just a blank thunderfury model.\n\nIn order to make it work, it needs lots of small complex emitters....",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
